@host = http://localhost:5217

### ---------- LAYER 1: route constraint ----------

### 1 not a number: 404, no route matches
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/abc

### ---------- LAYER 2 and 3: binding and annotations ----------

### 2 a body that cannot be parsed: 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "restaurantId": "one" }

### 3 every bad field reported at once: 400 with errors on four fields
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 0,
  "menuItemId": 0,
  "quantity": 99,
  "phone": "12345"
}

### 4 a phone that is not an Ethiopian mobile: 400 errors.phone
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "menuItemId": 1,
  "quantity": 1,
  "phone": "0811234567"
}

### 5 scheduled with no time (a rule across two fields): 400 errors.scheduledFor
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "menuItemId": 1,
  "quantity": 1,
  "phone": "0911234567",
  "isScheduled": true
}

### 6 a total sent by the client: 400, an unknown field is never accepted
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "menuItemId": 1,
  "quantity": 2,
  "phone": "0911234567",
  "totalEtb": 1
}

### 7 three decimal places: 400 errors.priceEtb
POST {{host}}/api/v1/menu-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Genfo",
  "category": "Breakfast",
  "priceEtb": 480.505
}

### 8 a price of zero: 400 errors.priceEtb
POST {{host}}/api/v1/menu-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Genfo",
  "category": "Breakfast",
  "priceEtb": 0
}

### 9 a blank name: 400 errors.name
POST {{host}}/api/v1/menu-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "category": "Drinks",
  "priceEtb": 50
}

### 10 a status that does not exist: 400 errors.status
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/orders/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Flying" }

### 11 limit out of range: 400 INVALID_PAGING
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants?limit=0

### 12 a typo in a parameter name: 400 UNKNOWN_PARAMETER
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants?aera=Bole

### 13 not a number: 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants?page=abc

### ---------- LAYER 4: business rules (Result) ----------

### 14 no such restaurant: 404 RESTAURANT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants/9999

### 15 no such menu item: 404 MENU_ITEM_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/v1/menu-items/9999

### 16 no such order: 404 ORDER_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/999

### 17 a closed restaurant: 409 RESTAURANT_CLOSED
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 2,
  "menuItemId": 7,
  "quantity": 1,
  "phone": "0911234567"
}

### 18 a move the order cannot make (order 1 is Delivered): 409 ORDER_STATUS_CONFLICT
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Preparing" }

### 19 PATCH does not cancel: 409 ORDER_STATUS_CONFLICT
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/orders/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Cancelled" }

### 20 cancelling a delivered order: 409 ORDER_ALREADY_DELIVERED
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1

### 21 the order total is below the 150 ETB minimum: 422 AMOUNT_INVALID
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 4,
  "menuItemId": 19,
  "quantity": 1,
  "phone": "0911234567"
}

### 22 an item from another restaurant's menu: 422 ITEM_NOT_ON_MENU
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "menuItemId": 13,
  "quantity": 1,
  "phone": "0911234567"
}

### ---------- GLOBAL HANDLER ----------

### 23 a deliberate throw (Development only): 500 INTERNAL_ERROR with a traceId and no stack trace
GET {{host}}/api/v1/debug/throw

### ---------- THE HAPPY PATHS ----------

### 24 place an order: 201 and a Location header. The total is worked out by the server
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "menuItemId": 1,
  "quantity": 2,
  "phone": "+251911234567"
}

### 25 a scheduled order: 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "menuItemId": 1,
  "quantity": 1,
  "phone": "0711234567",
  "isScheduled": true,
  "scheduledFor": "2030-01-01T10:00:00Z"
}

### 26 move an order forward: 200
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/orders/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "OnTheWay" }

### 27 cancel an order created above (use its id): 204 with no body
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/orders/3

### 28 create a menu item: 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/menu-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Genfo",
  "category": "Breakfast",
  "priceEtb": 95.50
}

### ---------- DAY 59: MIDDLEWARE ----------
### Set adminKey to the value of your Admin__ApiKey environment variable. Never commit a real key.
@adminKey = REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-KEY

### 29 send your own correlation id: it comes back in the X-Correlation-Id response header and in the log
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants?limit=1
X-Correlation-Id: bole-test-001

### 30 no id sent: the server generates one and returns it
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants?limit=1

### 31 an unsafe id is replaced, never echoed
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants?limit=1
X-Correlation-Id: bad id; DROP TABLE

### 32 an error body carries the same id as its traceId
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants/9999
X-Correlation-Id: bole-test-002

### 33 the admin branch without a key: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED, and the handler never runs
GET {{host}}/admin/stats

### 34 the admin branch with the right key: 200
GET {{host}}/admin/stats
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### 35 a slow request (Development only): the timing middleware logs a Warning
GET {{host}}/api/v1/debug/slow?ms=1500
